<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES FINAL STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES FINAL STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the final</p>
<p>round of four-day Supersport Series cricket matches (tabulated</p>
<p>under played, won, lost, drawn, batting points, bowling points,</p>
<p>total points):</p>
<p> Natal		   8   5   1   2   32   28  110</p>
<p> Western Province    8   4   1   3   28   27   95</p>
<p> Border		  8   4   1   3   25   25   90</p>
<p> Eastern Province    8   4   3   1   25   23   88</p>
<p> Transvaal	     8   3   3   2   24   28   82</p>
<p> Free State	    8   3   1   4   22   25   77</p>
<p> Boland		  8   3   4   1   14   26   70</p>
<p> Griqualand West     8   1   6   1   18   16   44</p>
<p> Northern Transvaal  8   0   7   1   15   22   37</p>
</text>
